target.legend = Write to
target.tags = Tags on photos
target.tags_hint = Immich tags on every photo you own in this album. Searchable only by you.
target.photo = Photo descriptions
target.photo_hint = Adds a line like “#miejsce/polska #sylwester” to each photo's description. Everyone who sees the photos can search it (search type: Description).
target.album = Album description
target.album_hint = Adds the album keywords line. Finds the album on the Albums page, also for people it is shared with.
target.photo_short = photo descriptions
target.album_short = album description

